1
00:00:00,367 --> 00:00:02,037
(Raj:)Anyway, so I'm sorry
to waste your time.

2
00:00:02,035 --> 00:00:03,665
(Raj:)And, uh... and good luck
with your screenplay.

3
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:05,000
(Claire:)Hang on.

4
00:00:05,005 --> 00:00:06,405
(Claire:)We're both adults.

5
00:00:06,406 --> 00:00:08,606
(Claire:)We can still get together
without it meaning anything.

6
00:00:08,608 --> 00:00:10,978
(Raj:)Not me. Ever since
you admitted we had a vibe,

7
00:00:10,977 --> 00:00:12,907
(Raj:)I've been planning our wedding.

8
00:00:14,314 --> 00:00:17,014
(Claire:)Look, it's just coffee.

9
00:00:17,017 --> 00:00:18,617
(Claire:)I'll ask you some questions
about science,

10
00:00:18,618 --> 00:00:21,448
(Claire:)and if you propose,
I promise to say no.

11
00:00:21,454 --> 00:00:24,694
(Raj:)Okay. That hurts a little,
but okay.

12
00:00:25,392 --> 00:00:26,922
(Claire:)Great. I'll text you.

13
00:00:26,926 --> 00:00:28,526
(Raj:)Bye.

14
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:29,828
(Penny:)All right.

15
00:00:29,829 --> 00:00:32,769
(Raj:)So, uh, we're meeting
for coffee like two adults.

16
00:00:32,766 --> 00:00:34,666
(Raj:)Everybody's happy. Easy peasy.

17
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:36,297
(Bernadette:)Are you gonna tell Emily?

18
00:00:36,302 --> 00:00:37,432
(Raj:)Yeah, of course.

19
00:00:37,437 --> 00:00:38,907
(Raj:)We have no secrets.

20
00:00:39,706 --> 00:00:41,436
(Howard:)When are you gonna tell Emily?

21
00:00:42,308 --> 00:00:44,508
He lied about the cream cheese!

22
00:00:44,511 --> 00:00:46,581
He ate the whole thing!
I saw him!

23
00:00:49,416 --> 00:00:51,916
(Amy:)Look, I know you think
I'm not right for Sheldon,

24
00:00:51,918 --> 00:00:53,918
(Amy:)but trust me,
I'm his best shot.

25
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:56,420
(Amy:)You have no idea
how much I put up with!

26
00:00:56,423 --> 00:00:58,693
(Meemaw:)I know more than you think I do.

27
00:00:58,691 --> 00:01:00,821
(Amy:)Really? You know what it's like
to have date night ruined

